Description:
    Generates reproducible synthetic spatial and contextual data for
    risk-related software development, testing, demonstrations, quality
    assurance, and analytical workflows. Provides tools for generating
    study areas, random points, square and hexagonal tessellations,
    irregular polygons, contextual attributes, and complete synthetic
    scenarios using 'sf' objects. Contextual data can represent hazard
    assessments, incidents, risk-register records, observations, and
    generic analytical variables. The package generates synthetic inputs
    and does not calculate or infer analytical risk outputs.
